_tmp_*

# Local Netlify folder
.netlify

# Backtest eval set: real customer emails pulled from Help Scout. Local only —
# never committed (PII). Regenerate with the pull workflow; see backtest/README.md.
backtest/fixtures/
backtest/reports/

# Playwright
/playwright-report/
/test-results/
/blob-report/
